{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_15452B06","title":"Ava coaches you to beat Pilk Dane","entry":"Dlg_15452B06::entry","exit":"Dlg_15452B06::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_5DF64263","articyId":"72057774426555245","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"So perhaps I should summarize your current assignment, as it is an unusual one.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So perhaps I should summarize your current assignment, as it is an unusual one.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47101","byteOffset":32152104,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_31F6BBC6","articyId":"72057774426555264","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"You are about to confront an unsuccessful comedian - who is also a negligent landlord - in a comedy roast where you teach him how to insult others.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You are about to confront an unsuccessful comedian - who is also a negligent landlord - in a comedy roast where you teach him how to insult others.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":600.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44997","byteOffset":31357216,"byteLength":492}},{"id":"DFr_43F1D6CB","articyId":"72057774426555283","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"And you do not expect to teach this landlord, Pilk Dane, how to be a better comedian. Instead, you hope to destroy his ego and crush his self esteem to impress a woman. This woman is attractive.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And you do not expect to teach this landlord, Pilk Dane, how to be a better comedian. Instead, you hope to destroy his ego and crush his self esteem to impress a woman. This woman is attractive.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23640","byteOffset":16821704,"byteLength":576}},{"id":"DFr_2436A20B","articyId":"72057774426555311","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Very good. Then perhaps I can offer some advice?","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Very good. Then perhaps I can offer some advice?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1800.0,"y":25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50226","byteOffset":33342784,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_B065F798","articyId":"72057774426555326","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Be smart, target his insecurities, and do not let him turn the tables on you. And I recommend you do one more thing when you face him in your comedy roast.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Be smart, target his insecurities, and do not let him turn the tables on you. And I recommend you do one more thing when you face him in your comedy roast.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":3000.0,"y":-100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24112","byteOffset":17001160,"byteLength":464}},{"id":"DFr_6CA4341A","articyId":"72057774426555341","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Win.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Win.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"ef